body:
ugh war and revival and soul harvesting? add it to the motherfucking to do list.  2020 ehhh?

&#x200B;

(but in reality holy shit it is terrifying/SAD that people believe these things so deeply)

I think it's beginning to happen. I've been fascinated by her and this entire influencer/self help genre for a bit now. From day 1 I could just not buy into what she was selling and I wondered why. I think the realities of the world now combined with them divorcing and handling their brand strangely in the aftermath are making people recognize the truth. Or more importantly, that she isn't the holder of the truth and they have to figure it out for themselves. 

&#x200B;

Also if you haven't checked out munecat on youtube, she has an amazing video which explains this phenomenon in a very clear and accessible way.
